## Authority boundaries preserved

- `Observed != Validated`; live canary outcome never becomes controlled validation automatically.
- System Optimization transaction/snapshot/rollback authority remains unchanged.
- Typed capture authority remains in `PerformanceCaptureCoordinator`.
- Slice 1 eligibility remains unchanged and must succeed before execution.
- Specialized BlueStacks/FF Guardian behavior remains unchanged.
- Global Controlled Benchmark Lease behavior remains unchanged.
- Item 4 learned reliability has not started.

## Next exact engineering action

After this documentary HEAD is exact-CI GREEN, continue Track 6 item 3 with a bounded **cooldown + Action Budget** slice. It must prevent repeated live-session intervention thrash while preserving the existing eligibility → reversible canary → typed outcome chain. Runtime host wiring remains the following item-3 slice; learned reliability remains item 4.
